            "action_name": {
              "value": "Rage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, emotion, mental)\n\nRequirements: Zashathal isn't fatigued or raging\n\nZashathal gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, he deals 12 additional damage with melee attacks and takes a \u20131 penalty to AC. Zashathal can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies Zashathal can perceive, or until Zashathal falls unconscious. Once the rage ends, Zashathal can't Rage again for 1 minute."
            },
